SY_TALK("8qEFnJLJn7c",[[5,["I'm sorry for being late."]],[106,["I was really very happy to learn that Sussex","University Sahaja Yoga centre has been very"]],[114,["kind to invite me to speak to them."]],[117,["It’s such a pleasure to talk to the students","because they are the ones who have always"]],[127,["been, in any country, been responsible for","any new step, whether it was political, economic"]],[139,["or social, which was to be taken boldly."]],[144,["Students are the people who have their idealism","intact still and when they are studying, they"]],[154,["don’t get biased easily."]],[156,["They keep their minds open to every knowledge","because they are new to it, but those who"]],[166,["become experts can become very biased, very","conditioned by what they read or they think"]],[174,["to be right."]],[177,["But, the students can also be very much vulnerable,","because they do not know whether whatever"]],[184,["new comes to them is the truth or some sort","of falsehood."]],[189,["So, at this life, when you are a student,","you have to be very careful to understand"]],[198,["that if you have to seek the truth, you have","to be alert about it."]],[204,["First and foremost thing as students we enter","into university."]],[211,["It’s a beautiful name ‘University’ meaning","that you get all the knowledge of the universe"]],[218,["and when you enter into university, you come","with an open mind and with an understanding"]],[227,["that whatever you have to learn in the way","of a student, you are not the teacher and"]],[237,["that humility always helps the students to","learn about anything they want to know about"]],[245,["any part of their knowledge."]],[251,["Now what you learn in the university is the","knowledge of the tree."]],[256,["Knowledge that you can perceive and understand","through your mental activity, but what I’m"]],[262,["going to tell you about today is the knowledge","of the roots."]],[267,["Roots of the tree, from where the whole knowledge","comes."]],[271,["Now to believe in me or to understand me,","it is not necessary for you to have any sort"]],[281,["of faith in me or a sort of surrendering position,","but you must also know that if I have to tell"]],[289,["you something new, you must keep your mind","open to understand what I have to tell you."]],[296,["When we study, say economics, take a subject","which is very common these days and it is"]],[305,["even regarded as a higher science than philosophy."]],[310,["What do we learn?"]],[311,["The essence of economics is very simple, that","‘wants’ in particular are satiable but"]],[325,["in general, ‘wants’ are not satiable."]],[328,["This is the essence of Sahaja Yoga also, like","whatever you want to have, you can have today"]],[339,["and tomorrow you will run after another thing."]],[344,["That’s why we have economics because this","is the tendency of the human mind, but why"]],[351,["it is so?"]],[353,["Why is it we really strive, supposing you","are doing your graduation, you will strive"]],[359,["your heart to be a graduate but you won’t","be satisfied."]],[362,["You would like to do higher studies or like","to take up a job and even if you get a job,"]],[367,["you will not be satisfied."]],[369,["Then you want to build a house, then you want","to have a car, then you students want to have"]],[373,["a nice bike, alright."]],[374,["When they have it, they want something else,","a helicopter maybe I don’t know what but"]],[379,["it goes on increasing, you are never happy","with what you have."]],[383,["Fully satisfied."]],[384,["Now the reason for that, you can find it in","Sahaja Yoga, because the roots are deeper"]],[392,["down which you do not know."]],[394,["It’s alright to build up the whole science","of economics on something but what about the"]],[400,["roots that have created this big tree of economics?"]],[406,["The roots are that none of these material","things are going to give us full satisfaction,"]],[413,["this is the root."]],[415,["So what is going to give us that satisfaction,","we come to the second logical question."]],[422,["What is the need of a human being to feel","satisfied?"]],[427,["There is something higher, something deeper,","something that we have missed."]],[432,["This is definite, now what is that?"]],[436,["We can refer if you are not upset or angry","or we can say biased about the scriptures,"]],[449,["any scriptures, I’m not saying Bible or","say Torah or Indian scriptures or Buddha sayings"]],[458,["or Tao or anything."]],[461,["You will find one common thing they have said,","all of them have said one thing common and"]],[467,["that is ‘that you are to be born again’."]],[472,["You have to know your Spirit, you have to","become the Spirit because that lacking in"]],[479,["us, in our awareness, because we are not yet","the Spirit, whatever we know without it is"]],[486,["only the mental projection, which is limited","as our mind is limited."]],[491,["So to know the unlimited or to know the roots,","you have to become the Spirit."]],[497,["This is the first condition they have given."]],[498,["Now if you just don’t deny them, we should","look into it, we just have to become the Spirit."]],[507,["Now what is that, what is that?"]],[510,["We can ask, which is the Spirit."]],[514,["If there is something like Spirit within us,","we have not yet felt it, we have never felt"]],[520,["the Spirit within us and what is that Spirit","and what does it do?"]],[526,["What are its qualities?"]],[527,["We should try to find out."]],[529,["That’s what you can find out when you become","the Spirit, it’s a vicious circle."]],[535,["The other way around, here nobody will say","that you must become a graduate to know about"]],[540,["economics, but the other way around thing,","you have to go deep down into the roots and"]],[549,["how do you do that?"]],[550,["Supposing I say you pay attention to yourself."]],[553,["A teacher will say ‘pay attention’ so","all the students will start looking at him,"]],[556,["looking at the blackboard, but I say pay attention","to yourself!"]],[560,["Then you will say ‘Mother how do you do","it?’"]],[563,["It’s an impossible thing, how do we take","our attention inside, it’s all the time"]],[567,["outside, how are we to take it inside?"]],[570,["That’s why you have to get your realisation","first, you have to become the Spirit by which"]],[575,["you can take your attention inside to your","roots, that’s why the first condition in"]],[580,["the Sahaja Yoga system is that we have to","become the Spirit."]],[585,["Before that, whatever I say, you will say","how is it true?"]],[590,["You can always challenge, you can always say","it may not be true, it may be wrong, it may"]],[595,["be false…it’s true, because supposing","I have no eyes and you start telling me about"]],[601,["the colours, how will I know?"]],[604,["So, anybody will say open your eyes first","of all, unless and until you open your eyes"]],[609,["you won’t be able to understand what I’m","talking about."]],[613,["In the same way we have to understand that","if we have to know about the roots, we have"]],[620,["to penetrate within, for that we have to become","subtler than what we are."]],[626,["We are at a level from which we cannot enter","inside ourselves, so we have to become something"]],[633,["else and that becoming is only possible if","you become the Spirit."]],[640,["I hope I’m clear on that point."]],[642,["Now, how to become the Spirit is the problem","because whenever a teacher tells you do this,"]],[648,["you say how?"]],[650,["That’s correct, I mean logically that should","be the question, how do we become the Spirit?"]],[658,["Now if I say, this is our evolutionary process,","we have evolved as human beings, come up to"]],[668,["this stage and if something more has to happen,","it has to happen the same way as evolution"]],[675,["has taken place, automatically."]],[680,["What did we do to become human beings from","monkeys?"]],[684,["If we have become from monkeys."]],[688,["I don’t think anybody remembers anything","they have done to become human beings or they"]],[693,["have put in any effort to be that, we have","done nothing, we have just become human beings"]],[699,["spontaneously or we can say automatically,","but actually spontaneity relates to a living"]],[711,["process."]],[712,["Only living things are spontaneous."]],[714,["You want to sprout a seed, you just put it","in the Mother Earth, spontaneously it sprouts,"]],[723,["we don’t do anything to it, we don’t stand","on our heads, we don’t read any book, we"]],[727,["don’t say anything to the seed but it sprouts","because it’s built in, within the seed,"]],[736,["the quality to become the tree."]],[739,["In the same way, it is built in within you","to become the Spirit."]],[743,["As you have become a human being, you have","to become the Spirit."]],[748,["That’s the evolutionary natural process","to which you have to take to."]],[753,["Now if you get satisfied just with whatever","state you are in as a human being, you can"]],[760,["live, not impossible, I mean you can while","away your time, you can carry on but still"]],[766,["you will not be a satisfied person."]],[769,["You will not be a blissful person, you will","not be a person who can be called as a person"]],[776,["who has become an absolute personality."]],[779,["Still you will be living in the relative world","because of this mental activity which is going"]],[784,["on, which will confuse you completely all","the time."]],[787,["You will not know whether this is good or","that is good, like these days in England we"]],[791,["have a big confusion whether to vote Labour","or Conservative or this."]],[796,["We don’t know which one to vote so we will","close our eyes, whichever I catch, I will"]],[799,["do it."]],[800,["We don’t know what to do."]],[802,["This stage will go away because we haven’t","reached that state of absoluteness where we"]],[809,["can decide things with absolute authority."]],[811,["This is the thing, this is the right thing."]],[816,["Once we understand this state that lies within","us, then what do we do?"]],[824,["We know what is right and what is wrong and","right can only be one thing, there cannot"]],[833,["be any difference of opinion as to what is","right and what is wrong if you do it with"]],[842,["your absolute awareness."]],[844,["But, human awareness is not absolute, if it","was so, there would have been no problem."]],[851,["There would not have been any necessity to","have this ‘mx’ authorised or have this"]],[857,["atom bomb produced there."]],[859,["Human beings are the only animals that are","doing like this, you don’t find any dogs"]],[865,["creating any atom bombs or anything to kill","each other, but this is special human failure"]],[872,["to show that we are not at an absolute point","where we all agree."]],[879,["So how to achieve that is the second point","again I said it is spontaneous, it’s a living"]],[885,["process and you don’t have to worry about","it."]],[889,["It’s all built in within yourself."]],[893,["So, how many of you have come for the first","time for Sahaja Yoga meeting?"]],[897,["Let’s see…(Shri Mataji counted five new","people and continues) the rest of you have"]],[908,["been to Sahaja Yoga meeting so you know about","kundalini, you know awakening of the kundalini"]],[914,["and all those things."]],[916,["Now we have within ourselves, this power by","which it is going to happen to us."]],[925,["This is the power of pure desire, of pure","desire within us because so far as we have"]],[933,["seen all our desires that we have cannot satisfy","us."]],[941,["So there must be some desire within us which","leads us to completion or to the fulfillment"]],[950,["of our ultimate desire to be the Spirit, and","this power lies in the triangular bone in"]],[960,["the lowest part of your spinal cord."]],[968,["Now this lies there or not, it exists or not,","whether I’m telling you is correct or not"]],[979,["is to be found out."]],[980,["You should not just challenge it, you should","see for yourself that sometimes in some people,"]],[986,["there are many who have seen it here, you","can see the pulsation of this power if there"]],[994,["is an obstruction in this person and the awakened","kundalini cannot rise."]],[1001,["You can see it with naked eyes absolutely","with naked eyes, a pulsation, just like a"]],[1006,["heartbeat."]],[1008,["In some people it is so vigorous that you","are amazed that this bone behaves, this triangular"]],[1015,["bone behaves like a heart beating."]],[1020,["Surprisingly, this bone is called a sacrum","and sacrum in Greek language means sacred."]],[1031,["Of course for all our knowledge, sacred word","is only in the dictionary, we don’t know"]],[1038,["what sacredness is, what divinity is, what","auspiciousness is, thank God there are words"]],[1045,["but we don’t know what it is supposed to","be."]],[1048,["Now this they call as a sacred bone and I","was amazed and I asked them, why did you call"]],[1056,["this a sacred bone, when I went to Greece."]],[1060,["I was even more amazed to find out that they","knew a lot about this knowledge."]],[1066,["They told me that they had rapport with Indians,","with great philosophers of India who came"]],[1072,["down and told them all about it and they had","this practice with them."]],[1080,["Even the knowledge of their medical science","was very much based on those ideas, even in"]],[1088,["England, when you had your medical science","first, you’ll be amazed the basis of it"]],[1094,["was the same as Sahaja Yoga system."]],[1097,["They had three types of human beings and they","are to be treated that way."]],[1101,["But then suddenly I don’t know from where,","we started curing, not through the roots but"]],[1108,["through the leaves."]],[1110,["If there is something wrong with the leaf,","you treat the leaf and then you find some"]],[1114,["trouble somewhere in the fruit, you see, it’s","like that."]],[1117,["So the medical science became like that, absolutely","treating the leaves and the roots were left"]],[1125,["behind."]],[1126,["Now these roots are within you."]],[1130,["They are there all the time, you are not aware","of them, you’re not aware of so many things"]],[1135,["within yourself, but once you become aware","of them, as you get your realisation."]],[1142,["As you get your Spirit manifesting in your","attention, in your central nervous system,"]],[1149,["when you start feeling the vibrations of the","Spirit flowing, then you can understand all"]],[1157,["about them."]],[1158,["Whatever I’m saying here today, you can","verify it and can find out."]],[1165,["To give you a simple example, is that when","you have to go to a class of histology, you"]],[1171,["have to use a microscope."]],[1172,["Now you say that I won’t use the microscope,","I would like to see the skin with my naked"]],[1178,["eye, you cannot, what you will see is the","skin that is there."]],[1182,["But if you have to see the deeper structure","of the skin, you have to use a microscope."]],[1188,["In the same way, if you have to see the deeper","side of life, you have to use the microscope"]],[1196,["of your Spirit."]],[1197,["Without the Spirit, you cannot understand","what is beneath and what is above."]],[1205,["Beneath is your beautiful being, the glorious","human being that is created by God and above"]],[1218,["is the all pervading power of love of God","Almighty."]],[1224,["May God bless you."]],[1226,["I would like to have questions from you."]],[1228,["That would be better than to talk about it","because I must have given, I don’t know"]],[1233,["how many, thousand lectures so far and there’s","no end to it because this is a vast knowledge."]],[1239,["Even if you have thousand universities like","that, I don’t think it can be completed,"]],[1246,["but it’s so simple."]],[1251,["Once you become that, I don’t have to tell","you much."]],[1256,["Like this room you have done, if I have to","explain about it to someone, I can write a"]],[1264,["book on this and still they won’t understand","anything."]],[1266,["They will come here and will never recognise","that this is the book I’ve told them about."]],[1271,["But if you just open your eyes and come here,","you see for yourself and know definitely this"]],[1276,["is the place you have to be."]],[1278,["That’s what it is when you become."]],[1281,["You don’t have to know all about it, you","just become that."]],[1287,["May God bless you."]],[1288,["I would like you to ask me questions, that","would be much better, what do you say Jason?"]],[1360,["Q: Is the energy tied physically to this bone,","the triangular bone?"]],[1373,["What happens to the poor unfortunate people","who might have lost the bone?"]],[1380,["A: No, I don’t think anybody has lost it","so far except they are devils you see."]],[1389,["It’s not lost easily and I would say that","just now we should worry about ourselves,"]],[1399,["isn’t it?"]],[1400,["So we can help others."]],[1402,["So we can help so many."]],[1404,["If we are not equipped, how can we help others?"]],[1407,["First we should equip ourselves then we’ll","think about others."]],[1410,["I’m happy you have thought for others, that’s","a good sign of generosity but we must have"]],[1415,["something within ourselves to give, isn’t","it?"]],[1423,["Q: In what way the chakras and triangular","bone, sacrum is associated with the physical"]],[1435,["body?"]],[1436,["If somebody is born with one arm, what happens","to the chakras?"]],[1440,["A: You see, even if you are, chakras are not","normally hurt because they are very much placed"]],[1448,["inside the inner core of the metulae, they","are very subtle things, they are not harmed"]],[1457,["easily, they cannot be harmed but it can be","possible that a person who has no backbone"]],[1463,["but such a person doesn’t exist."]],[1467,["I have seen people with crooked ones and they","get it straightened and it can work out with"]],[1477,["them, but without a backbone we don’t exist."]],[1490,["It’s a subtle thing and it’s an energy,","it’s an energy centre and it may be in your"]],[1500,["case it may be just on the borderline supposing","on the lumber area, it may move out with another"]],[1507,["one."]],[1508,["So that is not so important."]],[1509,["What is important is just now you see, instead","of going into details, first we must get our"]],[1516,["realisation and gradually you will be able","to locate everybody’s centres, where they"]],[1521,["are, because they pulsate and you can see","with your own eyes."]],[1527,["Q: If you see them with your own eyes, presumably","you can’t photograph them?"]],[1535,["A: We have photographs also, we have photograph,","we have films, everything we have done, but"]],[1542,["as I told you that every person has a different","style of awakening, in the sense that in some"]],[1549,["people like a little child, or say a person","who is simple hearted, say from a village"]],[1553,["where he is not so complicated, I mean who","doesn’t think too much you see this chakra"]],[1559,["goes out if you think too much (Shri Mataji’s","hand is at Agnya)."]],[1561,["Or sort of obstructions like that."]],[1564,["Then, such a person, if he takes, in a split","of a second the whole thing moves out, really,"]],[1570,["like a jet."]],[1571,["But, in a person who is a little complicated","or has a disease or physically handicapped"]],[1578,["or any sort of thing like that, then it takes","time."]],[1582,["It pulsates much more in those places where","they have a problem."]],[1588,["So it depends."]],[1589,["You cannot say that supposing you say that","take my photograph, it may not be there, so"]],[1594,["we have of course taken photographs, we have","films of that, everything."]],[1599,["But on some people we have seen it, not all","because you don’t keep a camera there all"]],[1604,["the time to take a photograph, we have taken."]],[1610,["Q: The"]],[1625,["camera is impartial so presumably if you find","one person who has this throbbing, you can"]],[1632,["do it again (Yogi: but surely Mother could","you also mention to him that the kundalini"]],[1637,["only throbs like that when there’s a problem","there…is that right?)"]],[1641,["A: What do you want to achieve by that?"]],[1643,["Let’s see, what’s the achievement?"]],[1646,["We should not side track, it’s a very important","issue but we should not side track alright?"]],[1651,["Keep it to the main point, what do we want","to do, why do we want to?"]],[1655,["You see the trouble is we would not like to","do anything wasteful, naturally, why should"]],[1661,["we do anything wasteful, for nothing at all,","isn’t it?"]],[1664,["What we would like to do is achieved easily","for the good of everyone without much difficulty,"]],[1673,["alright, so now to take a photograph, this,","that kind of a thing is not necessary."]],[1680,["There is no need to do it, but we have taken","photographs, no doubt we have taken because"]],[1685,["you see many a times I have many photographers","with me and people with a movie sort of camera"]],[1692,["are going on."]],[1694,["Then they have taken photographs, but it’s","of no use, as it is for our purpose, there’s"]],[1700,["no need to take a photograph."]],[1701,["But we have taken and now we have got it and","now as your question moves further with it"]],[1706,["that if somebody has a pulsation, it may disappear","after five minutes."]],[1711,["It may not be there, it’s just there for","the time being because if the kundalini is"]],[1715,["rising, it is moving upward you see."]],[1717,["So it may not be there, it may reach another","point or it just come out from here (Shri"]],[1719,["Mataji takes her hand to her Sahasrara to","demonstrate)."]],[1726,["Alright?"]],[1728,["You should ask me questions which has some","advantage, you see, to you and to me both"]],[1734,["because this is of no meaning, that we should","take a photograph, then we should do this,"]],[1738,["there’s no need to do that, what is the","need?"]],[1739,["Q: There’s no need for you to do it…"]],[1740,["A: But we have."]],[1741,["Q: I would have thought that if you believe","through true awakening people may realise"]],[1747,["the futility of desiring material things that","this was the sort of thing you would like"]],[1760,["to see established as soon as possible…."]],[1764,["A: That’s a good idea."]],[1766,["We have got it you see we have got but you","don’t know, the media people want something"]],[1771,["bad to happen."]],[1772,["They don’t want anything good to be said","that this is a way we can say things."]],[1777,["I think so, because they are not interested","much, in this country, not in other countries,"]],[1782,["but in this country I don’t think they are","very much interested if I tell them that there"]],[1787,["is such a power and we have a photograph and","you can see for yourself, and this happens"]],[1792,["and cancer can be cured, they are not interested."]],[1796,["What to do?"]],[1797,["It’s not easy."]],[1798,["Q: On the contrary, if you could talk about","this …(unclear from public)"]],[1805,["A: Alright, so next time I give you the responsibility,","you get them to me, they are terrible, you"]],[1811,["don’t know."]],[1812,["Just, I’ll give you a simple example alright."]],[1814,["I don’t want to talk against them, they","are after all good people, but they don’t"]],[1819,["see the point you see, that is important and","they just don’t want to understand."]],[1824,["Simple thing you see, they wanted to advertise","me alright, I’ll give you an example of"]],[1829,["these people, how their mind works."]],[1831,["So, I didn’t want to say much but I just","said one little sentence that England is the"]],[1839,["heart of the Universe, which I can prove."]],[1844,["And then I talked about William Blake, who","said that such and such a thing is going to"]],[1853,["happen and all that."]],[1854,["Where he has used the word that England has","to become Jerusalem."]],[1861,["I mean it’s an honorable thing I said for","them, so they raised an objection today only,"]],[1867,["that’s why I was delayed."]],[1870,["Saying that if you say England is the heart","of the universe, the Arabs will have objection."]],[1877,["You must understand, you see, you are a student,","you must understand what sort of people surround"]],[1885,["us."]],[1886,["I didn’t know what to say!"]],[1887,["Why will they have objection?"]],[1889,["Because they too have a place in the universe","but England if it is the heart, I have to"]],[1894,["say that, but supposing I am honouring you,","why should you not stand for your honour?"]],[1901,["Because if you in any case go to Falkland","to save your honour there, and here if I say"]],[1910,["a simple truth which I know, you don’t want","to say that just in an advertisement because"]],[1916,["the Arabs may catch it and they may disappear","from Harrods!"]],[1920,["So that’s our media, must understand it’s","not so simple as you think but I’ll be very"]],[1929,["happy if you can get me some of them."]],[1931,["It’s not easy, very difficult people, very","difficult."]],[1940,["Q: Are you prepared to say anything about….(unclear)"]],[1944,["A: Yes."]],[1945,["I’m prepared to say, not only that, but","I can prove it also but it is such a simple"]],[1949,["sentence, but I’m regarded as a Saint in","India, a well known Saint is saying that,"]],[1955,["one should take it as an honor."]],[1958,["But that’s not so."]],[1959,["That’s not so with people you see."]],[1962,["Here I don’t think they take Saints seriously","in England, perhaps, maybe, but Arabs are"]],[1968,["taken more seriously, must say."]],[1971,["Surprising you know, how can Arabs make an","objection to such a thing, I can’t understand"]],[1977,["but this is exactly the problem today I was","facing."]],[1981,["So I think you are the students but you still","don’t know the reality of what these people"]],[1986,["are like but one day you will realise."]],[1989,["I’m very happy your attention is on that,","I hope so it works out that way, then we can"]],[1994,["show them pictures and all that alright."]],[1997,["Now what else?"]],[1999,["It had only one purpose that I could explain","it better to you because I didn’t know what"]],[2006,["to say to these people, the way they came","out with Jerusalem and the objection to Jerusalem."]],[2012,["After all if William Blake said it but now","we can criticize it because the Arabs don’t"]],[2019,["like it."]],[2020,["Is that the way to look at things?"]],[2023,["Are the Arabs going to decide for us everything?"]],[2031,["Q: Would you be prepared to make any comments","about life on other planets?"]],[2037,["A: No there isn’t any, it’s as simple","as that."]],[2045,["Even if there are, they are not the type of","life which you are used to the different types"]],[2052,["of things."]],[2056,["Different style of life, we cannot call them","as life because our concept of life is different"]],[2062,["so we shouldn’t call them but as human beings,","the awareness of human beings, there is none."]],[2069,["But there is something like life you can call","it in some places, maybe the matter is moving"]],[2078,["like life but according to the human conception,","you would not call it life."]],[2093,["Q: Is there any difference between humans","and animal life on this planet?"]],[2104,["A: Difference?"]],[2107,["Tremendous!"]],[2108,["I’ll tell you one example."]],[2111,["You take your dog through a dirty lane, he","can pass through, you cannot."]],[2117,["Thousand and one, there is such a difference","between animals and human beings."]],[2123,["Q: You were talking about evolution earlier?"]],[2127,["A: Yes you have evolved to human state, no","doubt."]],[2135,["Q: Would you say in the course of evolution","that all life forms were the same and at one"]],[2152,["point we came at a different life form."]],[2188,["A: Human beings are made in such a way, they","can exist as people who can think and can"]],[2214,["create, it’s as simple as that."]],[2216,["You see, that’s why they have developed","these things."]],[2220,["Supposing an animal feels the dirt or anything,","he cannot remove it but human beings can."]],[2228,["He can create, see this is the difference","and that’s why so many things that human"]],[2235,["beings have, are only as an accessory to help","adjust his life to his surroundings, alright?"]],[2247,["But say you take a horse or a dog, they have","a certain sensitivity to an evil spirit but"]],[2258,["human beings don’t have that much sensitivity","to it."]],[2262,["There are some birds, if they disappear from","a part of Japan and all that, then people"]],[2268,["know that there is some sort of rumbling going","on in the Mother Earth and some earthquake"]],[2274,["is expected so people also start departing","from the birds you see."]],[2279,["There are so many birds as you have heard","that they go from one place to another, from"]],[2283,["Siberia all the way to Australia, how do they","do it?"]],[2287,["We can’t do it, because they have a magnet","developed within them which can feel and through"]],[2293,["which they go."]],[2294,["So, of course there are many things which","are dropped out in human beings and many things"]],[2299,["added to him, but are evolved because they","can create."]],[2305,["You can create."]],[2308,["Like an animal cannot create, that’s the","difference."]],[2316,["(Same person kept speaking so Shri Mataji","asked him to give others a chance and also"]],[2332,["the discussion is not about evolution at large,","Mother is saying that if you do not accept"]],[2338,["that you are more evolved than animals, how","can I argue it out?"]],[2342,["It’s a fact."]],[2343,["You are a human being, you’re definitely","more evolved than animals."]],[2353,["You can organise yourselves better, you can","create, you can think, they cannot think."]],[2359,["Can I talk to animals?"]],[2361,["Can I tell them what I have to tell?"]],[2364,["Not only that, their kundalini is not there","perfect yet to be awakened, this is the last"]],[2369,["point of it."]],[2370,["That’s not so important alright?"]],[2372,["Now let’s see, some other questions."]],[2376,["Same person still wants to ask one more!"]],[2390,["Q: If human beings have evolved from animals,","there must be something that was brought in"]],[2406,["to distinguish them from other things?"]],[2409,["A: Yes, very true, there is."]],[2413,["Raising of the head."]],[2415,["You see the way they have raised their body,","it has changed the shape of their body."]],[2420,["That’s why you must learn Sahaja Yoga, about","how the shape of the brain has changed."]],[2426,["What has happened that our attention has gone","out."]],[2430,["Everything you must know, that’s very true,","agreed on that point."]],[2433,["That’s the thing you have to learn."]],[2436,["That’s part of Sahaja Yoga."]],[2438,["Absolutely, what has changed human beings?"]],[2441,["First of all, they are given freedom, if you","believe in God."]],[2445,["They have been given freedom to decide."]],[2451,["Animals have no freedom, if it’s a dog it’s","a dog."]],[2454,["If it’s a cat it’s a cat, nature will","remain the same, but human beings could be"]],[2459,["a scorpion could be a lion could be a snake","could be anything so the freedom that has"]],[2466,["been given to human beings has made them higher."]],[2471,["They got this freedom in the expression when","you raised your head like this you see."]],[2478,["Also some physical happenings take place within","you, which of course I’ll tell you later"]],[2482,["on when you come to Sahaja Yoga meetings and","all that, you will realise how God has given"]],[2487,["you freedom and by freedom what you developed","is the ego within you and that ego has covered"]],[2495,["your head and you have developed the ‘I’ness."]],[2499,["That you are mr. x and mr. y and mr. z."]],[2504,["That ‘I’ness has come to you, your own","entity as mr. x, y, z."]],[2510,["You are cut off, much more from the Divine","power, in the sense that now you are your"]],[2520,["own guide."]],[2523,["The freedom is given for you to try the freedom."]],[2527,["Q: Are you saying that evolution was carrying","on in it’s merry way and God decided that"]],[2536,["some peculiar time …..(unclear)"]],[2537,["A: It is up to you, of course it is up to","you to decide."]],[2541,["You see at this juncture you have to decide."]],[2547,["At human level you must decide what you want","to do further, the decision."]],[2551,["Finally!"]],[2552,["Another student asks:"]],[2553,["Q: You say the attainment of Spirit is the","necessary step to see into yourself, but what"]],[2567,["actual steps can anybody take for attainment","of spirit and is there only one way or are"]],[2575,["there many ways?"]],[2576,["A: There’s only one way of sprouting."]],[2577,["Only one way that is built in within us, you","see, that’s the only way."]],[2582,["Q: Why as an individual want to attain that","Spirit to look into myself, what should I"]],[2595,["do, what practical steps can I personally","take towards…"]],[2596,["A: Yes, that’s very nice to say, that’s","what we have to do alright."]],[2597,["That I’ll tell you, that’s a good thing","to ask."]],[2600,["That is something nice and promising."]],[2603,["Alright?"]],[2604,["What else?"]],[2606,["Q: Mother, how far can the intellect take","us?"]],[2616,["Can we understand it with the intellect?"]],[2619,["A: How can you, you can’t."]],[2623,["You see intellect can only tell you, like","I came here, it was written University of"]],[2631,["Sussex, but I have to enter in."]],[2634,["This is like a signpost, with intellect you","can only know the signpost but you have to"]],[2640,["enter in, actually."]],[2642,["Supposing I give you a chocolate alright?"]],[2643,["It’s written cadbury’s, you read it but","you have to taste it, you have to experience"]],[2649,["it, that’s the difference between the two."]],[2652,["Just reading that mentally, knowing that mentally","is something like reading a signpost."]],[2661,["Experiencing it is like entering into it."]],[2663,["Intellect has it’s own limitations."]],[2666,["Like, we had to leave our car behind."]],[2673,["It’s beyond."]],[2676,["It’s the intellect of the intellect, you","can say that."]],[2679,["But it’s all poetry, you see what I’m","saying in reality we should see what it is."]],[2690,["So should we come to your question?"]],[2694,["Shri Mataji asks a child what she wanted to","ask."]],[2701,["Q: How does the kundalini raise when you are","rising it?"]],[2708,["A: When you are raising it how does it rise?"]],[2720,["It rises just like that (Shri Mataji makes","waving up motion with her hand) you have seen"]],[2735,["it, that’s it."]],[2738,["Shri Mataji (so joyfull) look at the child…"]],[2744,["Now any more questions?"]],[2747,["None?"]],[2748,["So coming to previous question alright?"]],[2753,["I can tell you in an analogy sort of thing","because you see when you have to understand"]],[2762,["something mentally, you have to use these","worldly things to explain something Divine."]],[2768,["We can say that if there is a candle which","is not enlightened, it cannot get enlightened"]],[2775,["by itself but it is ready to be enlightened."]],[2783,["If you are ready to be enlightened, any enlightened","light can enlighten you."]],[2789,["But the enlightened light doesn’t do anything","except you can say at the most it is a catalyst,"]],[2794,["at the most."]],[2795,["But, just it is ready , it’s all there,","just an enlightened light comes near the one"]],[2804,["and it catches the light from that."]],[2806,["It’s as simple as that."]],[2808,["To give an analogy."]],[2809,["As I told you, the seed when you put it in","the Mother Earth, because it is built in,"]],[2815,["it just sprouts, it’s built in, but the","process is that it has to be put in the Mother"]],[2821,["Earth."]],[2822,["In the same way, it being a spontaneous thing","and absolutely a living process, it works"]],[2830,["in a way that, supposing you have somebody","who is an enlightened light."]],[2835,["Say Ray has got enlightenment, for example,","so if he wants he can enlighten you."]],[2844,["Once you get enlightenment, you can enlighten","another person."]],[2848,["But Ray now knows what should be done to prepare","first of all the candle, to get rid of the"]],[2858,["obstructions, how to enlighten and how to","bring it to a full bright light."]],[2867,["He knows all that."]],[2869,["So there are three stages we can say."]],[2871,["First is you are to be awakened, the kundalini,","it has to be brought out of your head here"]],[2879,["(Shri Mataji’s hand above her head) so that","the cool breeze of the holy ghost you can"]],[2882,["feel it on your head."]],[2884,["This is the second stage where you start feeling","a cool breeze also in the hand."]],[2888,["So many people don’t feel in the beginning","in the hand also on the head they do not feel,"]],[2893,["because it’s a very subtle thing, but if","a Sahaja Yogi feels it that means it has started"]],[2901,["but in a very subtle way."]],[2902,["Then you must allow it to grow more and more","and to dispense all the obstructions on its"]],[2909,["way."]],[2910,["Gradually, it becomes a steady light and then","a Sahaj Yogi any Sahaj Yogi can put it in"]],[2920,["such a way that you start feeling it in your","hands also."]],[2924,["Starts flowing in your hands because from","the hands of a Sahaj Yogi, that power is flowing."]],[2929,["With that power, he can handle the situation","in such a way that your hands start feeling"]],[2936,["it, flowing from your hand, flowing from here","(Shri Mataji’s hand above her head)."]],[2940,["Now, when it happens, suddenly, sometimes","it happens to people in a very sudden way,"]],[2943,["in a sudden rush also because they have been","seekers for ages perhaps."]],[2949,["But then they feel, oh I feel very high, absolutely","on top of the world, I’ve become a witness"]],[2954,["now, naturally, because it is such a change","you see."]],[2958,["But, that’s not the end of it because you","must know how to kindle it properly, to keep"]],[2964,["it going and all that."]],[2965,["If you don’t do that, it will again come","down."]],[2969,["You must learn how to keep it going, how to","work it out."]],[2973,["That’s the part that’s the transition","part through which you have to go."]],[2977,["Some people take at the most eight days, some","people take a month or so."]],[2981,["But once you have done it, you become your","own master."]],[2985,["To give another analogy, a very simple one."]],[2987,["It’s like this, when you are driving a car,","there’s a break and an accelerator."]],[2996,["This is the freedom that has been given to","you first of all, to learn how to use the"]],[3001,["break and the accelerator."]],[3003,["To take the car in a proper way, to keep it","in the centre, the way it has to move."]],[3009,["Then once you have learnt it, what happens","is that you automatically become a driver."]],[3015,["Nobody has to tell you now put the break,","now do this."]],[3018,["You know it, automatically you develop it."]],[3020,["This is the second stage of driving."]],[3022,["Now the third stage is that you really become","an expert in that and you drive without even"]],[3030,["knowledge that you are driving, when you are","perfect."]],[3033,["But still there is one more stage left."]],[3037,["That there is a master sitting behind, who","wants you to drive this way and that way and"]],[3042,["the master says now stop the car."]],[3044,["He’s there."]],[3045,["Now what happens that when you really become","a Sahaja Yogi, is the point, when you become"]],[3051,["the master."]],[3053,["You start seeing the driver within you, and","the accelerator and the break, and you control"]],[3060,["as a master."]],[3061,["That’s the point you have to reach."]],[3062,["So these are the four stages through which","you have to pass, which gradually works out"]],[3067,["just like your graduation, without much difficulty,","for which you cannot pay."]],[3072,["But you must have respect for yourself, you","must know you can do it and you must have"]],[3079,["that understanding that you are a human being."]],[3084,["The epitome of evolution, and that you have","to become the Spirit."]],[3088,["It works out."]],[3090,["It works out very fast, these days and should","work out in this University also, alright."]],[3099,["Analogy should not be taken too far because","this is Divine working and Divine working"]],[3106,["is such that we can’t understand how it","works."]],[3109,["In the beginning, if I tell you, you’ll","be amazed how it works you see."]],[3112,["You will say now Mother explain, but I won’t","be able to explain so many things."]],[3118,["It’s tremendous."]],[3120,["The Divine power has all your communications","and everything."]],[3123,["It’s tremendous and in a split of a second","it works."]],[3130,["It is to be seen for yourself."]],[3132,["Now the time has come to prove the existence","of God, to prove the existence of his Divine"]],[3137,["power."]],[3138,["For the first time you start feeling the subtle","power when you get your realisation."]],[3142,["You start feeling it in your hands as cool","breeze of the Holy Ghost."]],[3147,["First time, otherwise you never feel it, alright."]],[3150,["Should we have it now?"]],[3154,["(Shri Mataji requests all new people to come","in the front row.)"]],[3160,["You shouldn’t mind if Sahaja Yogis just","put their hands above your heads."]],[3164,["Yogis will not touch you, but just to feel","you."]],[3201,["Now what you have to do is just put your hands","like this (open facing up), why? because these"]],[3205,["fingertips have got the representation of","your centres here."]],[3212,["These 5,6 and 7…they haven’t brought the","charts but you can see later on, they will"]],[3216,["give you books to see."]],[3217,["These are 5 centres, 6 centres and 7 centres","we have, so just put your hands like this"]],[3222,["and put your feet on Mother Earth, because","Mother Earth also helps us, wide apart without"]],[3229,["shoes."]],[3230,["Everything helps us, like all the elements","that are there can help us and we have to"]],[3234,["use."]],[3235,["So now put your feet on Mother Earth like","this and put your hands like this and you"]],[3240,["have to close your eyes that’s all."]],[3243,["Just close your eyes."]],[3247,["Now don’t try to control your attention","at all."]],[3256,["Keep your attention absolutely loose, you","just don’t worry as to where to keep the"]],[3262,["attention, what to think, what to do, nothing","of the kind."]],[3265,["Just leave it."]],[3266,["Keep your hands on your lap and sit very comfortably","and it will work out."]],[3271,["I’m sure it will work out for all of you."]],[3292,["(Shri Mataji places her hamsa on the speaker","for a couple of minutes.)"]],[3372,["You should not open your eyes until I tell","you."]],[3376,["Keep your eyes shut."]],[3377,["Take off your glasses if possible, it will","be a good idea."]],[3383,["It helps the eyes also."]],[3394,["Stretch your fingers a little bit towards","me like that, just stretch them, that’s"]],[3406,["all."]],[3407,["Shri Mataji rubs her hands and asks yogis","to see their chakras."]],[3424,["(New people’s chakras)"]],[3426,["Shri Mataji rubs her hands and blows into","them."]],[3432,["Right swadisthana is too much, I think you","all put them left to right, right swadisthana"]],[3437,["is too much."]],[3439,["All of them have right swadisthana, right","vishuddhi and right nabhi."]],[3442,["Put them left to the right, that’s the best","way, left to the right."]],[3526,["Those who have got it, you can ask them to","put their hands and feel it, if possible."]],[3544,["Please don’t feel guilty, any one of you","feel guilty that I’ve done this wrong that"]],[3562,["wrong, that’s not going to help us at all."]],[3577,["(yogis working on all seekers)"]],[3585,["Forgive, forgive everyone, just forgive."]],[3593,["What about this gentleman?"]],[3601,["Nabhi….let him put his left hand on his","liver, right hand towards me."]],[3621,["Left to the right."]],[3636,["Just don’t think, just enjoy."]],[3640,["Those who have got it, just enjoy and don’t","think, don’t think."]],[3649,["Now what about him?"]],[3652,["Heart, put your hand on your heart (Shri Mataji","moves her hand raising general kundalini and"]],[3664,["then around the heart)"]],[3668,["Ask him if he has done TM or something?"]],[3686,["Buddhist."]],[3688,["Right vishuddhi is too much."]],[3698,["Right vishuddhi, right liver put your habd","on his right vishuddhi and tell him to turn"]],[3734,["his head left."]],[3735,["Mmm the whole muscle is…..better now."]],[3746,["(Another seeker had ekadesha due to going","to another cult so Shri Mataji asked the yogi"]],[3788,["to put his hand around the seekers ekadesha","and put him right to left."]],[3816,["Shri Mataji generally checked on the seekers","and directed the yogis accordingly.)"]],[3822,["Shri Mataji told a seeker who had been involved","with hypnotism to keep her eyes open and look"]],[3830,["at me, try to hypnotize me now."]],[3837,["Alright now let’s see, watch me."]],[3848,["It’s very dangerous my child, to do all","these things, very dangerous."]],[3860,["Ah!"]],[3861,["Now see it’s up there, alright."]],[3867,["But you have to do something more alright,","to get released."]],[3894,["These are horrible things, you don’t know","how you hypnotize."]],[3928,["Q: Isn’t kundalini something I have to raise","myself?"]],[3972,["A: Yes she can"]],[4009,["do also, but first of all"]],[4042,["you have"]],[4054,["to become."]],[4057,["You have not become that, how"]],[4086,["can"]],[4105,["you do?"]],[4114,["What will you do?"]],[4129,["Unless and until you become and you understand","what it is alright."]],[4137,["Q: further questions..unclear"]],[4140,["A: First you have to become through the help","of somebody else, as I told you about the"]],[4145,["two lights alright."]],[4146,["One is an enlightened one, the other is enlightening","you."]],[4150,["Once you become, then you can enlighten others","alright."]],[4153,["So first you have to become that, fully."]],[4156,["So they are just helping you."]],[4157,["You see helping your light to be there steadily,","is it improving now in your hand?"]],[4164,["Q: No"]],[4166,["A: Nothing flowing?"]],[4168,["Q: No"]],[4170,["A: What’s the matter (Mother asks a yogi)….warm?"]],[4175,["It will work out."]],[4178,["It has to work out first of all, you have","to become that you see."]],[4184,["Q: what do I have to feel?"]],[4185,["I don’t know."]],[4187,["A: You will feel the cool breeze in the hand","and cool breeze out of your head."]],[4194,["So many of them felt."]],[4195,["Did you have any Guru or someone?"]],[4200,["No one?"]],[4203,["Q: Not in this sense but we do have a family","Guru."]],[4217,["A: Who is he?"]],[4229,["Q: We are supposed to be followers of Mahaprabhuji"]],[4243,["A: Who is he, from Bengal?"]],[4245,["Q: No from Mathura."]],[4247,["A: Mathura?"]],[4248,["What is the name?"]],[4249,["Q: Our family Guru but Valabh Acharya"]],[4252,["A: Valabh Acharya!"]],[4253,["Tremendous!"]],[4254,["Are you Valabh Acharyas?"]],[4256,["Q: He is supposed to be our family guru"]],[4261,["A: Valabh Acharya was a great realised soul","you see, you should get it in no time, in"]],[4266,["the name of Valabh Acharya."]],[4267,["Put your hands like this (open and palms up)","Was he the Ashtachaap?"]],[4269,["Q: Yes"]],[4271,["A: Oh tremendous!"]],[4274,["Hah!"]],[4275,["Got it?"]],[4276,["Are you feeling now?"]],[4280,["Q: No"]],[4282,["A: You should."]],[4283,["Valabh Acharyas are great, they are very great","people."]],[4286,["If they follow it properly."]],[4288,["Q: But I can’t feel it."]],[4296,["A: She has got cold that’s why her vishuddi","is catching."]],[4303,["That is Valabh Acharya’s chakra himself."]],[4306,["Yes his chakra is catching, he was great."]],[4313,["They are called Vaishnavas."]],[4318,["I’m doing all his work only."]],[4325,["This is all Vaishnav Panth."]],[4330,["What he said, I’m doing it."]],[4333,["It’s not only worshipping him but you have","to become what he said."]],[4337,["To be Vaishnav Janas."]],[4338,["Q: Then you can be Vaishnav Janas by being","nice to people."]],[4350,["A: No no, you have to become a realised soul."]],[4354,["You must have atma sakshatkar."]],[4358,["Do you read him?"]],[4360,["Do you read him or not?"]],[4362,["Q: Not so much"]],[4364,["A: Then you read him, then you’ll understand","what I’m saying nothing but what he says."]],[4368,["You have to get atma sakshatkar."]],[4369,["Q: But I feel this is not the way to get it,","atma sakshatkar I must get within myself."]],[4373,["A: Then why do you need Valabh Acharya?"]],[4377,["Q: I don’t know but I don’t think I need","some sort of community thing to start feeling"]],[4387,["in myself."]],[4389,["A: Whatever you think is from your own knowledge","no?"]],[4392,["You don’t know anything about it?"]],[4394,["Then better not think about it because you","don’t know."]],[4398,["Q: I’ve been taught a lot about Valabh Acharya","by family etc"]],[4403,["A: Did they get atma sakshatkar?"]],[4407,["Your family and people?"]],[4408,["Q: I don’t know."]],[4409,["A: Then how do you say that?"]],[4410,["They are not authority."]],[4412,["Those who have got atma sakshatkar are only","the authority."]],[4416,["Q: yes but how do I know who has got atma","sakshatkar?"]],[4419,["A: At least you try to find out, we are trying","to help you."]],[4422,["We are not going to gain anything out of you","are we?"]],[4425,["Then why not try?"]],[4426,["Q: It must be more personal, it can’t be","done in a public way like this"]],[4438,["A: If you believe in Valabh Acharya, then","you are telling just against him because he"]],[4443,["never believed in this kind of a thing."]],[4446,["It was all public, because he was a great","believer of Shri Krishna and not only Shri"]],[4451,["Krishna did Sahaja Yoga with gopis and raas","and everything, all publicly, he didn’t"]],[4456,["do it sitting down in the rooms, alright?"]],[4461,["So this is the wrong idea you have got."]],[4467,["They have all got it I think except for these","two."]],[4474,["She has touched but no use."]],[4476,["You see she is neither a full Valabh Acharya","or not half way, so if you are educated enough…"]],[4482,["Shri Mataji interrupted by same girl in public.."]],[4483,["Q: I’m just an ordinary simple person who","came here to find out"]],[4487,["A: Yes, but what I’m saying is to find out,","you must accept certain things isn’t it?"]],[4492,["Q: Why should I accept anything?"]],[4495,["A: No, I’m saying you have come to find","out alright."]],[4497,["If you go to a school or to university, you","have to find out."]],[4501,["Not by giving your own ideas, ‘I think’","is not there."]],[4504,["What ‘I think’ you listen to it, isn’t","it?"]],[4507,["I think whatever you think is different, that’s","the point."]],[4510,["Q: That doesn’t prove that you’re better","than me or I’m worse…."]],[4515,["A: I may not be better than you or maybe worse","or whatever it is, but you have come to listen"]],[4519,["to me na?"]],[4520,["Q: If I would just listen to you and think","about it and thought your concept….but this"]],[4526,["kind of physical exercise is not working.."]],[4531,["A: Is it?"]],[4532,["Q: It doesn’t bring out anything in me."]],[4537,["A: What I’m saying, it isn’t in you only,","others have got it."]],[4541,["You are the only one who hasn’t got it."]],[4545,["It’s alright, if you haven’t got it, then","you haven’t got it."]],[4550,["We can’t help it also, we can’t help you."]],[4551,["We are sorry, that’s all we can say, but","they have got it and all of them have got"]],[4556,["it."]],[4557,["You haven’t got it and he hasn’t got it","either."]],[4561,["It’s the vishuddhi."]],[4562,["Both of them haven’t got it that’s all."]],[4564,["Only two persons haven’t got, what can we","do about it."]],[4567,["What about her?"]],[4568,["Is she alright?"]],[4570,["You see if it doesn’t work out what can","we do?"]],[4573,["We can’t help you."]],[4574,["Q: unclear comments…"]],[4575,["A: It’s alright."]],[4576,["That’s all, we can’t work on you."]],[4578,["This is not possible."]],[4579,["Q: I don’t want anybody to work on me, I","want to go myself."]],[4584,["A: Alright so you go ahead work it on yourself,","alright."]],[4588,["May God bless you."]],[4597,["Easy to be worked out."]],[4601,["I saw an Indian, I knew what was going to","happen."]],[4603,["They are very uprooted, they neither know","the Indian things or the English things."]],[4608,["You see nothing in between."]],[4610,["That’s the problem."]],[4613,["Immigrants."]],[4614,["They neither know the Indian things, I mean","she’s a Valabh Acharya."]],[4617,["Anybody, we have so many disciples from Valabh","Acharya, so many have come and she doesn’t"]],[4623,["know what it is."]],[4624,["Can you believe it?"]],[4626,["She doesn’t know what kundalini is when","Valabh Acharya has talked of nothing else"]],[4629,["but this."]],[4630,["How can you believe she’s from Valabh Acharya?"]],[4633,["Just keeping a photograph of somebody is not","that, you must know what he’s talking about."]],[4639,["That’s what it is, they are"]],[4640,["a very uprooted people in England."]],[4643,["Very uprooted, they don’t know Indian music,","they don’t know anything."]],[4648,["Just they wear Indian dresses that’s all."]],[4652,["He’ll be alright, just"]],[4653,["he has centre heart, he’ll be alright."]],[5010,["I ’ll vibrate it for you, it will give you","a better liver and the whole system will improve"]],[5017,["with that water."]]]);
